	"talks": [
		{
			"id": 7105401,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7105402
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_AUTO",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7105402",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7105402,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Yanbo",
					"Paimon"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 710540101,
					"content": "Stop! Please stop! Let us explain!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540102,
					"content": "Aren't you guys just a bunch of Treasure Hoarders? Just turn yourselves in. There's nothing to explain around here!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540103,
					"content": "#Millelith Squad Leader Yanbo of The Chasm District, at your service. It's an honor to meet you, {NICKNAME}.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540104,
					"content": "And your... most eminent flying companion.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540105,
					"content": "Hey, hey, hey, it's Paimon to you, mister!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540106,
					"content": "Haha... I apologize. I'm very sorry, but I think there's been a small misunderstanding here.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540107,
						710540109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540107,
					"content": "So... you're not Treasure Hoarders?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540108
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710540108,
					"content": "Well, no, just the opposite.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540112,
					"content": "*cough* Well, and you're not wrong to say that this area was indeed one of the Treasure Hoarders' lairs.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540113,
					"content": "After the workers were dismissed, those weasels wormed their way in here... At first, they were just mining, smuggling some Glazed Sand Crystal, and playing hide-and-seek with our patrols.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540114,
					"content": "But they would grow bolder as time went on, even breaking into and occupying the old warehouse that the miners left behind. They even used the tools there to make their own cheap little trinkets to sell! *sigh* Breaks my heart every time.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540115,
					"content": "What breaks your heart?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540116
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710540116,
					"content": "Such rough-hewn trinkets can only be used to cheat first-time visitors to Liyue or some ivory-tower scholars. And I'll bet that they'll try to get them on the market using lower prices, too, perhaps even try undermining some legitimate brands.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540117,
					"content": "It's not like they've got any brand power themselves, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540118,
					"content": "That's true. I suppose it's a joke in poor taste to think that they'd make good Mora off this...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540119,
					"content": "That's why we came here and took care of the Treasure Hoarders who originally held this position, before disguising ourselves as them and lying in wait... Well, that was a while back now.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540120,
					"content": "We had managed to ascertain thus far that one of their leaders is in contact with a branch of the Fatui, and that they may be preparing a transaction involving dangerous items.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540121,
						710540124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540121,
					"content": "About the contact between the Fatui and the Treasure Hoarders...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540122
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710540122,
					"content": "Although we foiled the Fatui's plots before, they maintain some strength out here in the wilds... Their professionalism and combat prowess are not to be underestimated. Indeed, we consider them opponents of the utmost peril.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540123,
					"content": "If they were to team up with the Treasure Hoarders to go against us, it could pose a very tricky security risk indeed.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540126,
					"content": "Whatever the case, we were fully prepared for an all-out assault. We just needed to catch them all in one fell swoop, and then we'd have known what they were up to...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540127,
					"content": "And that's when we arrived...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540128,
					"content": "*sigh* I mean, we knew that you were good, but we didn't think that you were *this* good... You've pretty much incapacitated about half the people under my command...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540129,
					"content": "Of course, we were here for another reason... This is where one of the Bedrock Keys that hold up the Seven-Star Array is located. We couldn't allow that to fall into the Treasure Hoarders' hands.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540130,
						710540132
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540130,
					"content": "Um, sorry...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540131
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710540131,
					"content": "Hahaha! It's not that big an issue. It was partly our fault for not recognizing you, anyway... An order came down that we were to let you pass, but we never expected you to get here this quickly!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540134
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540134,
					"content": "Wow, this guy is pretty easygoing, huh? Does this mean we can leave?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540135
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540135,
					"content": "Uh... So, just because I don't blame you doesn't mean that Liyue's laws won't. Hehe, sorry about that.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540136
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540136,
					"content": "Eh!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540137,
						710540138
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540137,
					"content": "Finish your sentence next time, will you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540139
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710540139,
					"content": "Hmm, let me see: battery and assault, obstructing the Millelith in their duties, attempting to destroy the Seven-Star Array, and... damaging premises.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540140
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540140,
					"content": "Even with the Millelith's consideration... Congratulations, you'll be offered food and board in Liyue for an extra five to ten years!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540141
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540141,
					"content": "Eh!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540142,
						710540144
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540142,
					"content": "Do I get a lawyer?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540143
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710540143,
					"content": "That's right, give us a namelist!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540146
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540146,
					"content": "*cough* But, uh, please, let me finish!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540147
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540147,
					"content": "However, if law-abiding citizens or outlander guests might use legal means to assist the Millelith in their duties, they can gain the reward and compensation due to them. This, too, is the law of this land.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540148
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540148,
					"content": "So don't worry, that fight previously was not utterly in vain.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540149
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540149,
					"content": "So, what do we get from helping you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540150
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710540150,
					"content": "Well, stolen goods should not be so casually moved, but if you're willing to aid us, any items that you may coincidentally find along the way... for example, \"a Treasure Hoarder's secret stash\" or something, is yours to do with as you please.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540151
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540151,
					"content": "We also have some Mora on us, which I hope you won't mind having. It's not a lot, but we weren't counting on needing outside \"help\" like this either...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540152
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540152,
					"content": "Sooo that means no jail time and treasure to be had. Is that right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540153
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540153,
					"content": "Yes.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540154
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540154,
					"content": "Alrighty then, you've got yourself a deal, mister! Lead the way!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540155,
						710540156
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540155,
					"content": "One moment...!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540157
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710540157,
					"content": "Alright, don't be too reserved now... I'm going to head to our rendezvous point to await further orders. Catch up soon, or we'll act first.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540158
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540158,
					"content": "Okay! C'mon, let's follow 'em!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540159
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540159,
					"content": "Hey...!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540160
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710540160,
					"content": "Come on, we're assisting with official duties, y'know? And there's Mora to be had, too!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540156,
					"content": "I haven't...!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540157
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710540144,
					"content": "You know, I could have hit you a lot harder...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540145
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710540145,
					"content": "Hmph! We were just batting some annoying-looking people around, after all! You guys were wearing Treasure Hoarder uniforms, come on!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540146
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540138,
					"content": "You did that on purpose...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540139
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710540132,
					"content": "Um, looks like we really beat up the wrong people this time...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540133
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710540133,
					"content": "Well, yes? But as I said, the fault was ours first.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540134
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540124,
					"content": "About the dangerous items...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540125
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710540125,
					"content": "My contact says that those Fatui have exchanged a large amount of Mora and material for something the Treasure Hoarders have... But all he discovered was food and daily necessities, which we fear might just be a ruse.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540109,
					"content": "You're... Millelith?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540110
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710540110,
					"content": "Haha, I apologize for the lack of explanations. In fact, we thought that you were saboteurs yourselves.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540111,
					"content": "Well, from a certain point of view...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7105402,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7105403",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7105403,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Yanbo"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 710540201,
					"content": "You're here. Wonderful. I knew you would be willing to help out.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540202,
					"content": "The Treasure Hoarder smugglers should be undertaking their transaction with the Fatui in the large encampment in the east. They have also set up three smaller camps along the way.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540203,
					"content": "According to the information provided by the contact, these are the <color=#00E1FFFF>cooking quarters</color> to the southeast, the <color=#00E1FFFF>weapon stash</color> further east, and the northeastern <color=#00E1FFFF>alchemy camp</color>. If we are able to take these three camps by surprise, we should be able to cut off their supply line.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540204,
					"content": "Thanks to the previous incident with the Jade Chamber, we've had few patrols in this area, so they've had their fun so far, so much so that they've slackened their guard significantly. This is our chance to strike.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540205,
					"content": "It's just that... Our misunderstanding earlier has left us with only enough support to secure one encampment. But if you need it, we will assist all the same.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7105403,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_NONE",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7105403",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7105403,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
