		{
			"id": 7105407,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7105413
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_AUTO",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7105413",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7105413,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Yanbo",
					"Paimon"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 710540701,
					"content": "That was amazing. Thanks for your aid. Right, here's your reward.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540702
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540702,
					"content": "Woohoo, Mora! Eh? When did you change your clothes?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540723
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540723,
					"content": "When you start fighting... Well, I mean, that's not important. But we had to change our uniforms, lest you ended up sending us flying again in the heat of battle.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540703
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540703,
					"content": "The Millelith thanks you for your aid, as always. Ah, and as per our contract, feel free to look around and see if there's anything that you need.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540704
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540704,
					"content": "Well, other than the things that we've impounded, of course.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540705,
						710540707
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540705,
					"content": "Congratulations on a job well done.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540706
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710540706,
					"content": "Well, it was thanks to you that things went quite so well.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540709,
					"content": "Uh, what I mean to say is... As long as you don't take illegal shortcuts like these bandits, we won't come knocking at your door.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540710
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540710,
					"content": "Hmph. That's not the kind of people we are!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540711
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540711,
					"content": "True, true, haha...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540712,
					"content": "*sigh* Back on topic... People like you who can use the elements really are a force to be reckoned with, regardless of whether you mean to do good or ill...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540713
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540713,
					"content": "A mission that we would have needed weeks, even months to accomplish, was but child's play to you... If turned to evil, such abilities could produce outsize damage at a very small price.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540714
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540714,
					"content": "That's why I don't really rue the fact that I don't have a Vision.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540715
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540715,
					"content": "I have seen people who dedicated their lives to seek superhuman power, only to become tools and puppets for others to use as they pleased. Do you think that was worth it?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540716
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540716,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540717
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710540717,
					"content": "Those without Vision-based powers make up the vast majority of humans, and those who can truly understand and protect them are, similarly, ordinary folk.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540718
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540718,
					"content": "As an ordinary person, I am proud to be among those who can protect the many.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540719
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540719,
					"content": "Even if someday, Visions ceased to be given out, and even the adepti who defend Liyue Harbor were to pass away... I would not abandon this post of mine.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540720
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540720,
					"content": "Ah, um, sorry... I spoke too much. I didn't take up too much of your time, did I?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540721
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540721,
					"content": "Alright, we've got checks to do and contraband to mark out, so I guess we'll cut the chit-chat short here.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540722
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540722,
					"content": "Once again, I'd like to thank you on behalf of our comrades. May the rest of your journey be smooth-sailing. While the Millelith stands guard, evil shall never prevail!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				},
				{
					"id": 710540707,
					"content": "So that means we get out of jail free?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540708
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710540708,
					"content": "Of course, you were assisting the Millelith... I mean, you were apprehending smugglers with the aid of the Millelith. How could we ever put you in prison?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710540709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yanbo"
				}
			]
		},
